e on your quote so you can schedule the rough-in with confidence."}]'::jsonb, '/images/products/brand-rack-a-tiers-extendo-nut-driver.webp');
insert into public.products (slug, sku, name, collection, category, price, "compareAt", featured, short, description, specs, stock, meta_title, meta_description, long_description, faqs, image_url) values ('rack-a-tiers-panel-buddy-knockout-kit', 'RACKATIERS-ATIERSPANELBUDDYKNOCKOUT', 'Panel Buddy Knockout Kit', 'commercial-lighting', 'led-flat-panel', 0, null, false, 'Tired of trying to remove knockouts? Remove knockouts in half the time, with half the effort and prevents damage to the drywall.', 'Tired of trying to remove knockouts? Remove knockouts in half the time, with half the effort and prevents damage to the drywall.', '["Genuine Rack-A-Tiers product","Distributed by Green Solar World Inc.","Call for wholesale pricing"]'::jsonb, 'in-stock', 'Panel Buddy Knockout Kit Canada', 'Buy the Panel Buddy Knockout Kit wholesale in Canada. Genuine Rack-A-Tiers product — cULus/DLC certified, flat $30 shipping.', 'The Panel Buddy Knockout Kit is a commercial-grade LED flat panel for offices, schools, clinics and retail back-of-house spaces. Genuine Rack-A-Tiers product with a uniform, glare-free lens that meets modern workplace standards. GSW supplies commercial LED lighting wholesale to Toronto-area contractors, with DLC-listed models that qualify for utility incentives and stock ready for pickup or flat-rate shipping.', '[{"q":"Is this panel DLC listed?","a":"Yes — our commercial panels carry DLC or DLC Premium listing, which qualifies many projects for Hydro One and Toronto Hydro rebate programs. We can provide the DLC ID on request."},{"q":"2x2 or 2x4 — which do I need?","a":"Match the existing grid: most Toronto commercial ceilings are 2x2 or 2x4 T-bar. Retrofit kits are also available if you are converting from parabolic troffers — call us with the fixture count."}]'::jsonb, '/images/products/brand-rack-a-tiers-panel-buddy-knockout-kit.webp');
